# Work Order 1 - book name and book render probe.
#
# P1: is BOOK name writable from the load context?
# P2: does a book still render after a substring substitution in its text?
#
# Three layers: the write, an independent readback, and an on-screen report
# from the live session. Launch with run-probe.bat. This file is passed on the
# command line, so the WO0 spike beside it does not load. Remove by deleting
# mod/ contents.

LOAD:   scripts/wo1/bookname_load.lua
GLOBAL: scripts/wo1/bookname_readback.lua
PLAYER: scripts/wo1/bookname_hud.lua
